th 400-simulation search (~0.5 s a game), 20% itself. Head-to-head checks every 50 iterations.","rejected":"keeping r1's league (flat at ~68% / ~49% for 100 iterations)"},{"t":"2026-11-17 20:03:09","kind":"decision","title":"Method: one network for every decision, behaviour cloning then PPO with a league","text":"Third method, deliberately unlike the GA (evolved rules) and az-v1 (tree search over buys): a 298-256-256-34 MLP answers all ~22 kinds of decision, imitates the GA genome first (1.08 M decisions, 98.5% agreement), then improves by PPO (clip 0.2, GAE lambda 0.95, entropy 0.01) against 40% GA base, 15% bots, 15% past snapshots, 30% itself. Runs in C inside the engine: 3 ms per game, so 3,000 games per ~10 s iteration.","rejected":"more search (az-v1 showed it saturates); evolution again; a value-only method (DQN) \u2014 PPO is the standard, stable choice for a large discrete action space with masking"}],"reports":[],"strip":{"alive":true,"run":"r2","stage":null,"goal_text":"70.0%","stages_text":"0 of ? stages passed","best_text":"69.6%","verified_text":"68.4%","verified_sub":"r1 iteration 200, n=1000"}}